{"id":"familia","lemma":"familia","pos":"noun","rank":191,"glosses":["family (group of people related to each other)","family (grouping of things possessing common characteristics)","relative, relation (member of one's family)"],"ipa":"/faˈmilja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"familias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-familia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Odio a mi familia.","en":"I hate my family.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162694"},{"text":"Veinte familias viven aquí.","en":"Twenty families live here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600027"},{"text":"Nosotros no somos familia.","en":"We're not family.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/416011"},{"text":"Tenemos familias que debemos cuidar.","en":"We have families we have to take care of.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768009"},{"text":"¿Qué tal tu familia?","en":"How's your family?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/412346"}]}